      "text": "let span = _endTime - _startTime;\nlet atual = toscalar(CostsMulticloud() | where ChargePeriodStart >= _startTime and ChargePeriodStart < _endTime | where Provider in (_provider) | summarize sum(EffectiveCost));\nlet anterior = toscalar(CostsMulticloud() | where ChargePeriodStart >= _startTime - span and ChargePeriodStart < _startTime | where Provider in (_provider) | summarize sum(EffectiveCost));\nprint ['Variação %'] = iff(anterior > 0, round(100.0 * (atual - anterior) / anterior, 1), real(null))",
